\subsection{Research attempt}
\paragraph{Model, date and investigated scope.}
OpenAI GPT-6 Astra (configured model \texttt{gpt-6-astra}), ultra reasoning; generated 11 October 2026. Derives the Schur-complement Gaussian free energy and an exact-arithmetic linear-cost banded harmonic subcase.

\paragraph{Sources and literature check.}
